    "labels": [],
    "instructions": "You read a question that came in from outside and turn it into a request about the employee survey. intent: identify_person if it asks who said or answered something, group_question if it asks about numbers for teams, other otherwise. teams: the teams it is about (design, product). excludePeople: names of people the question wants left out. A message with several concerns gives one entry per concern in concerns.",
